1.46.m:
Declare with absolute certainty its belly, feet, and lineages.
Brahmā said:
The metre is Gāyatrī; the deity of Gāyatrī is certainly Savitṛ;

Speak of their ritual placement on the limbs in proper order, O father.
Brahmā said:
The apāna breath is in the region of the anus, and the prāṇa is in the heart of an embodied being;
